<opsproc code="00022744.0003001" revdate="2021-11-18T11:40:13"><title>Tachometer</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.001"><title>General Information</title><procbody lid="N.00022744.0003001.002"><action layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.003" memory="false"><command code="00022744.0003001.001"><para layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.004">For performance computation,
select in PEP the tachometer inoperative item only. Do not select
additionally the brake inoperative item in PEP as brake inoperative
performance impact is already part of tachometer inoperative performance
impact.</para></command></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.005"><title>Flight Preparation/Limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00022744.0003001.007"><action layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.008" memory="false"><command code="00022744.0003001.002"><para layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.009">Determine the associated Flight
Manual performance penalties with the OCTOPUS program.</para><note code="00022744.0003001.003" layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.010"><para layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.011">In the Airbus <abb>EFB</abb> <abb>PERF</abb> applications, this corresponds to the <abb>MEL</abb> item "WHEEL TACHOMETERS 1 TACHOMETER INOPERATIVE".</para></note></command></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.012"><title>Before Takeoff</title><procbody lid="N.00022744.0003001.013"><action layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.014" memory="false"><command code="00022744.0003001.004"><para layer="1" lid="N.00022744.0003001.015">Check that no other amber brake
released indication is displayed on the <tech-label type="s-page">WHEEL</tech-label>.</para></command></action></procbody></procitem></opsproc>